<title>USA: Carver Federal Q2 net, shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Carver Federal Q2 net, shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.36   profit	$0.036</p>
